#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1336
msgctxt "helms"
msgid ""
"Maneuvers the ship with thrusters and impulse engines, employs faster-than-"
"light propulsion methods, docks with other ships and space stations, and "
"retrieves objects"
msgstr ""

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1339
msgctxt "weapons"
msgid ""
"Manages a ship's offensive and defensive systems; loads, unloads, aims, and "
"fires weapon tubes; targets beam weapons; and sets beam and shield "
"frequencies"
msgstr ""

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1342
msgctxt "engineering"
msgid ""
"Manages a ship's power, heat, coolant, and damage; directs repair crews; "
"tracks system effectiveness; and controls the ship's self-destruct system"
msgstr ""

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1345
msgctxt "science"
msgid ""
"Examines and reports on the ship's surroundings, and researches entities "
"using the ship's sensors and database"
msgstr ""

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1348
msgctxt "relay"
msgid ""
"Manages the flow of information between the ship and other ships and space "
"stations across the region, hails and communicates with other entities, "
"launches scan probes, sets navigational waypoints, and hacks hostile entities"
msgstr ""

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1351
msgctxt "tactical"
msgid ""
"Combines the responsibilities of Helms (maneuvering, propulsion, docking) "
"with Weapons (loading, targeting, and firing weapons). However, also lacks "
"Weapons' control over shields."
msgstr ""

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1354
msgctxt "engineering+"
msgid ""
"Manages a ship's power, heat, coolant, and damage; manages shield activation "
"and calibration; directs repair crews; tracks system effectiveness; and "
"controls the ship's self-destruct system"
msgstr ""

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1357
msgctxt "operations"
msgid ""
"Combines the responsibilities of Science (scanning, research) with Relay "
"(communication, navigation). However, also lacks Relay's access to the "
"sector map or hacking features."
msgstr ""

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1360
msgctxt "single_pilot"
msgid ""
"Combines essential functions from Helms, Weapons, and Relay, at the expense "
"of several other features"
msgstr ""

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1363
msgctxt "beam_weapons"
msgid ""
"Manages and targets the ship's beam weapons, as a specialized subset of "
"Weapons functions"
msgstr ""

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1366
msgctxt "missile_weapons"
msgid ""
"Manages and targets the ship's weapons tubes, including missiles and mines, "
"as a specialized subset of Weapons functions"
msgstr ""

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1369
msgctxt "damage_control"
msgid ""
"Manages the ship's repair crews from a systems overview display, as a "
"specialized subset of Engineering functions"
msgstr ""

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1372
msgctxt "power_management"
msgid ""
"Routes power and coolant to the ship's systems, as a specialized subset of "
"Engineering functions"
msgstr ""

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1375
msgctxt "database"
msgid ""
"Researches information in the ship's database, as a specialized subset of "
"Science functions"
msgstr ""

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1378
msgctxt "docking_bay"
msgid ""
"Controls the ship's internal docking bay, if any, including launching, "
"reparing, and restocking berthed ships"
msgstr ""

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1381
msgctxt "strategic_map"
msgid ""
"Views a sector map, launches scan probes, sets navigational waypoints, and "
"hacks hostile entities. A specialized subset of Relay functions, with "
"communications delegated to the Comms screen."
msgstr ""

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1384
msgctxt "comms"
msgid ""
"Displays active communications with other entities, as a specialized subset "
"of Relay functions"
msgstr ""

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1387
msgctxt "ships_log"
msgid "Displays the ship's log, as a specialized subset of Relay functions"
msgstr ""

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1390
msgctxt "radar"
msgid ""
"Displays a non-interactive ship's radar at short, long, and sector ranges, "
"as well as of any linked probe, as a specialized subset of Science and Relay "
"functions"
msgstr ""

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1393
msgctxt "probe_camera"
msgid ""
"Displays the view from the linked probe's camera, with rotation controls"
msgstr ""

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1396
msgctxt "target_analysis"
msgid ""
"Displays known information about a target linked to this screen by the "
"Science officer, as a specialized subset of Science functions"
msgstr ""

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1399
msgctxt "briefing"
msgid ""
"Displays the scenario's briefing presentation, if implemented by the scenario"
msgstr ""

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1402
msgctxt "drone_operations"
msgid ""
"Provides control over linked probes, if the ship has a drone controller and "
"linked drones are within control range"
msgstr ""

#: src/menus/shipSelectionScreen.cpp:1405
msgid ""
"Select at least one crew screen to play.\n"
"You can select multiple crew screens and switch between them during the "
"game. You can also select the main screen alongside any other screen, which "
"splits the screen to show the viewscreen if your display's width is "
"sufficient."
msgstr ""

