msgctxt "tweak-ai"
msgid ""
"Autonomous ship behavior. Set orders (attack, defend, dock, etc.), target "
"entity, and target location for AI control.\n"
"\n"
"To issue movement, attack entity, dock with entity, or defend entity orders, "
"right-click on the target coordinates or entity while this entity is "
"selected. To issue other orders, select it from the Orders menu at the "
"bottom-right of the GM screen.\n"
"\n"
"This component can't be removed from an entity using the tweaks menu."
msgstr ""

