msgid ""
"The faction to which this entity belongs. An entity's faction determines "
"which entities are friendly, neutral, or hostile to this entity in combat "
"and interactions. This can also be set using the faction selector at the top "
"left of the GM screen."
msgstr ""

#: src/screens/gm/tweak.cpp:3993
msgctxt "tweak-spin"
msgid ""
"Makes the entity rotate continuously at the given rate in degrees per "
"second. Useful for terrain and decorative objects, such as asteroids and "
"debris. Combine with Planet renderer to roughly simulate planetary rotation, "
"particularly with other entities using Orbit.\n"
"\n"
"Ships should instead use the Manuvering thrusters component to control their "
"own rotation."
msgstr ""

