#: src/gui/hotkeyBinder.cpp:400
msgctxt "hotkey_menu"
msgid ""
"Discrete: Acts only once when pressed. (Buttons, encoders, switches)\n"
"\n"
"Continuous: Acts every frame for as long as it's held down. (Steering using "
"buttons, smooth sliders)\n"
"\n"
"Repeating: Acts once, waits, then acts repeatedly. (Keyboard repeating, "
"sliders with stepped values)\n"
"\n"
"Axis one-way: Control rests at a minimum value and is fully engaged at its "
"maximum. (Triggers, throttles)\n"
"\n"
"Axis two-way: Control is centered at rest and can be pushed in two "
"directions from there. (Joysticks)"
msgstr ""

